</td>
<td width="54%" valign="top">
<h1><font face="helvetica">New Title Deed</font></h1>
<p><font size="2">This is a proof of document showing the actual owner of the specified lot</font></p>
</td>
<td width="20%">
<div style="text-align: right;"><img src="https://gip.itc.utwente.nl/exercises/images/wfms_lease-logo.png" width="75" height="50" /></div>
